/* Full assembled mass-flow ventilation equation as implemented in
   livelab.mo (out_vent_flow). This is Wang & Chen 2012 Eq. (15) for
   volumetric flow Qbar, scaled by air density to give a mass flow,
   sign-flipped for inward-flow convention, and clamped to a baseline
   infiltration value.

   var_cd       discharge-coefficient modifier (Wang & Chen 2015 hopper, see cd.mac)
   Cd_rect      rectangular reference Cd  (= p_cd_rect = 0.62)
   l            opening width  (= p_win_width)
   Cp           pressure coefficient (Swami & Chandra 1988, see cp.mac)
   p_vent_area  aperture area (see vent_area.mac)
   winSpe       wind speed at z_ref [m/s]
   z_ref        reference height for wind profile = 10 m
   rho_air      ambient air density = 1.2 kg/m^3
   Q_min        infiltration floor = -0.00366 kg/s
*/

display2d: true$
linel: 90$

Q_unclamped : -1 * (var_cd * Cd_rect * l * sqrt(abs(Cp)) * p_vent_area)
              / z_ref^(1/7) * winSpe * rho_air$

print("Mass flow before clamp:")$
print(Q_unclamped)$

out_vent_flow : min(Q_unclamped, Q_min)$
print("As coded (with infiltration floor):")$
print(out_vent_flow)$
